ing tests run this code without asserting it"},{"name":"TestEngine_SocketAndSessionName","reason":"pins Socket() returning the told socket key and SessionName() the worktree basename; its covering tests run this code without asserting it"},{"name":"TestEnsureSelvagePaneLocked_SplitsOnceBelowTheBottommostPane","reason":"pins the Selvage create path's split-window call: targeting the bottommost pane with no -b, pinned to PaneCwd, launching the shell as the trailing argument and never via send-keys, then recording the new pane id; its covering tests run this code without asserting it"},{"name":"TestEnvScrub_Apply","reason":"pins EnvScrub.Apply stripping exactly the told names and prefixes, reporting them in environ order and leaving other keys and an unaffected environ as they were; its covering tests run this code without asserting it"},{"name":"TestLaunchScriptCleanup","reason":"pins every path forgetting a strand deleting exactly that strand's launch script, a recursive remove deleting the subtree's, a replace keeping the survivor's, and a remove without a script succeeding with no launch-script warning; its covering tests run this code without asserting it"},{"name":"TestLaunchStrandLockedStillComposesThePrelude","reason":"pins launchStrandLocked still calling composePaneLaunchLine, so the allowlisted chokepoint cannot become a plain pass-through; its covering tests run this code without asserting it"},{"name":"TestLaunchStrandLocked_LaunchScript","reason":"pins what a launch types and writes: any discard-line key, the source statement then a separate Enter, and a launch script holding the prelude joined onto the command, regenerated on relaunch, the bare command when the executable is unresolvable and the prelude alone for an empty command; its covering tests run this code without asserting it"},{"name":"TestLaunchStrandLocked_SkipsTheRedundantReEnumerationWhenNothingIsReaped","reason":"pins launchStrandLocked issuing no kill-pane when reconcile reaps nothing and 